    "description": "",
    "content": "<p><strong>用户场景：</strong> 常见于销售账户和统计账户分开，账户录入错误，财务对账，财务管理等场景。</p>\n<p><strong>功能介绍：</strong> 商户可以将一个账户中的金额转入到另一个账户中。</p>\n<p><strong>操作步骤：</strong></p>\n<p>资金-选择账户-点击要转出的账号后面的三点水，然后点击转账。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202306/0a98e19196900ab672fdb4c5d80acda2.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202306/0cc91fca9d02748fa26837effba909ec.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202306/ee69526c77f3ec6ab1bb9a1680a001d2.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n",
